&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re solving this by building financial services that just work: no account fees, instantly available, and accepted everywhere. In places where electricity, water and roads don&#39;t always work, you can still send money with Wave. In 2017, we launched a mobile app in Senegal for cash deposit, withdrawal, and peer-to-peer and business payments. Now, we have millions of users across 9 countries and are growing fast.&lt;/p&gt;
